# For the script navy-first-fleet: the Union computer starts its first fleet at Philadelphia
# (ai_fleet_orders), and has no shipyard for it.
# May 1862, the Rebels play. Their one ship lies off Philadelphia, the Union's only sea port, so
# the Union has no shipyard. The Union has no fleet, and cash for a ship after it fortifies
# and recruits.
date 5 1862
side 2
cash 3050 500
fleet 1 - 0
fleet 2 W 30
